                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's absolutely broken. It's a game where the toons are automated. If they can't do their jobs right, like an issue with building doors or an issue where you can't claim a defeated ship and thereby turn off its guns, but you have a build order in front of where the gun is and build orders cannot be cancelled...\n\nI liked where they were going with it. It's like one of those \"tycoon\" games (like Two Point Hospital or something), but broken is broken. If you buy a car and one of the wheels stops working like 5 or 10% of the time, you still can't drive that car,",
